    "title": "<p>Indications for surgical resection for intraductal papillary mucinous neoplasm (IPMN) and mucinous cystic neoplasm (MCN) as outlined by current guidelines and the American College of Radiology (ACR) white paper</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Barbara Ann Centeno",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 697.4pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"930\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Guidelines</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Cyst type</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Absolute indication</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Relative indication</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>ACR (2017)</strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28533111}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">IPMN or MCN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">IPMN or MCN:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Jaundice</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Enhancing mural nodule</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>MPD &gt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Indications for EUS-FNAB: high-risk features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Mural nodules</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Wall thickening</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>MPD &gt;&nbsp;7&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Peripheral calcifications</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Cyst &gt;&nbsp;25&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Interval growth (&gt;&nbsp;20% in longitudinal axis)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">ACG (2018)</span></strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29485131}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Indication for multidisciplinary review:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Jaundice secondary to the cyst</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Acute pancreatitis secondary to the cyst</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Significantly elevated serum CA19-9</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Any of the following imaging findings: mural nodule, solid component, dilation of MPD &gt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm, focal dilation of the MPD, mucin-producing cysts &ge;&nbsp;30&nbsp;mm</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">The presence of HGD or pancreatic cancer on cytology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>AGA (2015)</strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{25805375}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">MCN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>All MCNs</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 34.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 34.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">IPMN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 34.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>MPD &ge;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm (on MRI and EUS) and solid component</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Cytology positive for malignancy</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 38.05pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 38.05pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">European evidence-based guidelines (2018)</span></strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{29574408}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 38.05pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">MCN</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 38.05pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Cyst diameter &ge;&nbsp;40&nbsp;mm</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Enhancing mural nodule</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Symptoms (jaundice, acute pancreatitis, new-onset diabetes mellitus)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 38.05pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 103.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 103.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black;\">IPMN</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 103.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Positive cytology for malignancy or HGD</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Solid mass</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Jaundice (tumour-related)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Enhancing mural nodule (&ge;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">MPD dilatation &ge;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mm</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 103.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Growth rate &ge;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm per year</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Increased levels of serum CA19-9 (&gt;&nbsp;37&nbsp;U/mL)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">MPD dilatation between 5&nbsp;and 9.9&nbsp;mm</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Cyst diameter &ge;&nbsp;40&nbsp;mm</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">New-onset diabetes mellitus</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Acute pancreatitis (caused by IPMN)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"color: black;\">Enhancing mural nodule (&lt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"123\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>International consensus guidelines (revised) (2017)</strong> <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{28735806}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">MCN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>All MCNs</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 75.75pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 63.8pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 75.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">IPMN</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 248.05pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 75.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Cytology suspicious or positive for malignancy, includes cytology with features of HGEA</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Jaundice (tumour-related)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Enhancing mural nodule (&gt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>MPD dilatation &ge;&nbsp;10&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 293.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 75.75pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Growth rate &ge;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm over 2&nbsp;years</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Increased levels of serum CA19-9</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>MPD dilatation between 5&nbsp;and 9&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Cyst diameter &ge;&nbsp;30&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Acute pancreatitis (caused by IPMN)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Enhancing mural nodule (&lt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mm)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Abrupt change in diameter of MPD with distal atrophy</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Lymphadenopathy</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Thickened or enhancing cyst walls</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">ACG, American College of Gastroenterology; AGA, American Gastroenterological Association; HGD, high-grade dysplasia; HGEA, high-grade epithelial atypia; MPD, main pancreatic duct.</p>",
